    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sculptor you create statues of girls: broke stone segments, use special skills and paint color. Improve your skills with the teacher and become more effective in creating sculptures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Follow the story of a lonely sculptor who created a statue of a girl and fell in love with her. To bring her to life, he makes a deal with the goddess Aphrodite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Unusual mechanics of three-stage sculpture creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. A strong story inspired by ancient Greek myth of Pygmalion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The setting of Ancient Greece and myths.</p>",
